---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure | 10Best Living" description="Our commitment to transparency and honest recommendations.">
  <div slot="header"><Header /></div>
  <div slot="footer"><Footer /></div>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-playfair text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <div class="p-6 card border-l-4 border-gold mb-8">
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-dark">Transparency matters to us.</strong> As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This means when you click on links on our site and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Our Commitment to You</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Affiliate relationships never influence our editorial decisions. We test and review products independently, and our recommendations are based solely on merit, performance, and value. A product earns a top ranking because it deserves it — not because of any financial arrangement.</p>
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">FTC Compliance</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">This disclosure is provided in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission (FTC) 16 CFR Part 255: Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in Advertising. We want you to know that our opinions are our own and are not influenced by compensation from manufacturers or retailers.</p>
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Which Programs We Participate In</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-muted mb-8">
        <li>&#x2022; Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</li>
        <li>&#x2022; Individual brand affiliate programs</li>
        <li>&#x2022; Other reputable affiliate networks</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, please contact us at hello@10bestliving.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>